  "narrative": "<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Short impact summary</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Knowledge and practical knowledge (2024), published by Peter Lang Verlag, has no recorded citations, downloads or public discussion yet. This is an early record rather than a quiet one — the signals collected for it so far are thin.</p>\n<h3 class=\"story-subheading\">Full narrative</h3>\n<p class=\"story-text\">Knowledge and practical knowledge by Silvia Carbone was published by Peter Lang Verlag in 2024. It is part of the Travail et Société / Work and Society series. Conceptually, the work connects to Knowledge management, Construct (python library), Action (physics), Affect (linguistics) and Social knowledge.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">OpenAlex records no citations for the book so far.</p>\n<p class=\"story-text\">It is recorded in 3 library collections.</p>",
